msgstr "ለተገላቢጦሽ ፍለጋዎች ጥቅም ላይ የሚውለውን ሁለተኛ የDNS IP አድራሻ ያስገቡ."

#: setup.php
msgid "DNS Timeout"
msgstr "የDNS ጊዜ ማብቂያ"

#: setup.php
msgid "Please enter the DNS timeout in milliseconds. Mactrack uses a PHP based DNS resolver."
